  "description": "Define your roots in every day commuting style. Crispy fresh Crust is here! City loving pizza bike that loves to bump and jump over the curbs. Based on a Cromoly steel frame, singlespeed drivetrain, disc brakes, flat handlebar, and fat 650B urban tires, this bike will put a smile on your face with every ride, whether you're heading to work or to meet up with your friends at a pizzeria. The components have been chosen with simplicity and durability in mind so that the bike remains hassle-free for a long time. Compatibility with standard fenders makes the bike a perfect tool for getting around town in style in any weather conditions. The front rack allows the rider to easily carry their luggage, work stuff or pizza boxes for the whole of your familia.\nTough steel frame and fork, NS geometry\nFat WTB 650B x 47c tires\nPizza rack\nMechanical disc brakes\nFlat 31.8 handlebar",
